{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06414","headline":"送郝判官 · 李颀","name":"送郝判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚城木叶落，夏口青山遍。\n鸿鴈向南时，君乘使者传。\n枫林带水驿，夜火明山县。\n千里送行人，蔡州如眼见。\n江连清汉东逶迤，遥望荆云相蔽亏。\n应问襄阳旧风俗，爲余骑马习家池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}